OL,3,AUK government approves drilling in
OL,4,AJackdaw gas field with production to
OL,5,Astart this month
OL,6,
OL,7,FEnergy Secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh
OL,8,Ftells the BBC the gas from Jackdaw
OL,9,F"won't lower energy bills this winter"
OL,10,F- our business editor says the new
OL,11,Ffield will contribute less than 3% of
OL,12,Fthe UK's gas needs
OL,14,FEnvironmentalists argue more drilling
OL,15,Fwill hamper efforts to cut
OL,16,Fplanet-warming carbon emissions, and
OL,17,Fthat the government should transition
OL,18,Fsooner to greener technologies
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
