OL,3,ARoyal Family arrives in Aberfan as
OL,4,Avillage marks 60 years since coal tip
OL,5,Adisaster killed 116 children and 28
OL,6,Aadults
OL,7,
OL,8,FPeople in Aberfan, south Wales, are
OL,9,Fremembering the disaster 60 years ago
OL,10,Fwhen a coal waste tip collapsed on a
OL,11,Fschool and homes
OL,13,FOn 21 October 1966, 116 children and 28
OL,14,Fadults were killed when the colliery
OL,15,Fspoil tip collapsed and engulfed
OL,16,FPantglas Junior School and surrounding
OL,17,Fhouses
OL,19,FEmergency services, miners and people
OL,20,Fwho rushed to the village began an
OL,21,Faround-the-clock battle to dig out
OL,22,Fthose trapped by the debris
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
