OL,3,ARoyal Family arrives in Aberfan as
OL,4,Avillage marks 60 years since coal tip
OL,5,Adisaster killed 116 children and 28
OL,6,Aadults
OL,7,
OL,8,FMair Morgan, the last surviving teacher
OL,9,Fat the school, still remembers having
OL,10,Fto identify the children who died
OL,12,FKing Charles, Queen Camilla and the
OL,13,FPrince of Wales are joining survivors,
OL,14,Fbereaved parents and other members of
OL,15,Fthe community at a memorial garden that
OL,16,Fstands on the site of the school
OL,18,FA prayer and moment of silence was held
OL,19,Fat 09:15 to mark the moment the coal
OL,20,Fspoil struck the village
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
