OL,3,ALawyer caught offering to make
OL,4,Aillegal-worker fine go away
OL,5,
OL,6,FA solicitor has been secretly filmed by
OL,7,Fthe BBC explaining how he could make a
OL,8,F#45,000 illegal-working fine go away.
OL,10,FMohammad Alias Yousaf - also known as
OL,11,FAlias - made the claim to an undercover
OL,12,Freporter, who was posing as a mini-mart
OL,13,Fowner facing a fine for employing an
OL,14,Fillegal worker.
OL,16,FThe Bradford-based solicitor told his
OL,17,Fpotential client he could avoid paying
OL,18,Fthe fine, if he could find someone
OL,19,Foverseas prepared to declare themselves
OL,20,Fthe owner of the mini-mart.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
